      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You will analyze emails from Google Business Profile (businessprofile-noreply@google.com). Your task is to extract the following structured information:\n\n- Reviewer's full name\n- Reviewer's title or role (if available)\n- Star rating (e.g., 5-star, 4-star)\n- Review content (if provided, otherwise say \"Only rating given\")\n- A link to reply to the review (remove the tracking info everything after '?fid=')\n\nEmail content: \"{{ $json.text }}\"",
